#: ../../source/docs/assisted_fixed_wing_flight.rst:5
#: 29d330ab82754c9b9caa063cec926838
msgid "Assisted Fixed-Wing Flight"
msgstr "辅助固定翼飞行"

#: ../../source/docs/assisted_fixed_wing_flight.rst:7
#: ef20f71fd60144cdb247830baf3e8f7f
msgid ""
"The QuadPlane code can also be configured to provide assistance to the fixed"
" wing code in any flight mode except :ref:`MANUAL <manual-mode>` or "
":ref:`ACRO <acro-mode>`. VTOL motor assistance is enabled if "
":ref:`Q_ASSIST_SPEED<Q_ASSIST_SPEED>` is non-zero. If left at its default "
"value (0), a pre-arm warning will occur telling the user to set this "
"parameter. a value of -1 disables assistance features and suppresses the "
"pre-arm warning."
msgstr ""
"QuadPlane 代码还可配置为在除 :ref:`MANUAL <manual-mode>` 或 :ref:`ACRO <acro-mode>` "
"外的任何飞行模式中为固定翼代码提供辅助。若 :ref:`Q_ASSIST_SPEED<Q_ASSIST_SPEED>` 非零则启用 VTOL "
"电机辅助。若保持默认值（0），将出现预解锁警告，提示用户设置此参数。值为 -1 则禁用辅助功能并抑制预解锁警告。"

#: ../../source/docs/assisted_fixed_wing_flight.rst:10
#: 659196162dd14fc9a3c5dab181ef2ae8
msgid ""
"When :ref:`Q_ASSIST_SPEED <Q_ASSIST_SPEED>` is non-zero and positive then "
"the quad motors will assist with both stability and lift whenever the "
"airspeed drops below that threshold. This can be used to allow flying at "
"very low speeds in :ref:`FBWA <fbwa-mode>` mode for example, or for assisted"
" automatic fixed wing takeoffs."
msgstr ""
"当 :ref:`Q_ASSIST_SPEED <Q_ASSIST_SPEED>` "
"为非零正值时，每当空速降至该阈值以下，四轴电机将同时辅助稳定性和升力。例如，这可用于在 :ref:`FBWA <fbwa-mode>` "
"模式下以极低速飞行，或用于辅助自动固定翼起飞。"

#: ../../source/docs/assisted_fixed_wing_flight.rst:16
#: 83b0da20f88a401d9486259e5ffd8ddd
msgid ""
"If you are not using an airspeed sensor, airspeed will be determined by the "
"synthetic airspeed generated internally as a backup in case of airspeed "
"sensor failure. This estimate can be very inaccurate at times. You may want "
"to consider not enabling  Assisted Fixed Wing Flight if not using an "
"airspeed sensor to prevent false activations when airspeed really  is above "
"the threshold but is being misrepresented by the internal airspeed. Setting "
":ref:`Q_ASSIST_SPEED <Q_ASSIST_SPEED>` to -1 will disable the pre-arm "
"warning and assistance except in transitions."
msgstr ""
"如果不使用空速传感器，空速将由内部生成的合成空速作为备份（以防空速传感器故障）确定。此估计有时可能非常不准确。若不使用空速传感器，可能需要考虑不启用辅助固定翼飞行，以防止在实际空速高于阈值但内部空速错误表示时误触发。将"
" :ref:`Q_ASSIST_SPEED <Q_ASSIST_SPEED>` 设为 -1 将禁用预解锁警告和辅助（过渡期间除外）。"

#: ../../source/docs/assisted_fixed_wing_flight.rst:18
#: 272984b12ded4edcbbd708393dc0b915
msgid ""
"It is suggested that you do initial flights with :ref:`Q_ASSIST_SPEED "
"<Q_ASSIST_SPEED>` disabled just to test the basic functionality and tune the"
" airframe. Then try with :ref:`Q_ASSIST_SPEED <Q_ASSIST_SPEED>` above plane "
"stall speed if you want that functionality."
msgstr ""
"建议先在禁用 :ref:`Q_ASSIST_SPEED <Q_ASSIST_SPEED>` "
"的情况下进行初次飞行，以测试基本功能并调参机架。然后，如果需要该功能，再尝试将 :ref:`Q_ASSIST_SPEED "
"<Q_ASSIST_SPEED>` 设置在飞机失速速度以上。"

#: ../../source/docs/assisted_fixed_wing_flight.rst:24
#: d668dca425f1486086764fe95881bf1c
msgid ""
"A second assistance type is available if "
":ref:`Q_ASSIST_SPEED<Q_ASSIST_SPEED>` is a positive value based on attitude "
"error. If :ref:`Q_ASSIST_ANGLE <Q_ASSIST_ANGLE>` is non-zero then this "
"parameter gives an attitude error in degrees above which assistance will be "
"enabled even if the airspeed is above :ref:`Q_ASSIST_SPEED<Q_ASSIST_SPEED>`."
msgstr ""
"如果 :ref:`Q_ASSIST_SPEED<Q_ASSIST_SPEED>` 为正值，还有第二种基于姿态误差的辅助类型。若 "
":ref:`Q_ASSIST_ANGLE <Q_ASSIST_ANGLE>` 非零，则该参数给出姿态误差的角度（度），超过该角度时即使空速高于 "
":ref:`Q_ASSIST_SPEED<Q_ASSIST_SPEED>` 也将启用辅助。"

#: ../../source/docs/assisted_fixed_wing_flight.rst:30
#: fa9ad25a60aa4b98bbdd418bc4e93cfd
msgid ""
"A third trigger to provide assistance. if "
":ref:`Q_ASSIST_SPEED<Q_ASSIST_SPEED>` is positive, is "
":ref:`Q_ASSIST_ALT<Q_ASSIST_ALT>`. This is the altitude below which "
"QuadPlane assistance will be triggered. This acts the same way as "
":ref:`Q_ASSIST_ANGLE <Q_ASSIST_ANGLE>` and "
":ref:`Q_ASSIST_SPEED<Q_ASSIST_SPEED>`, but triggers if the aircraft drops "
"below the given altitude while the VTOL motors are not running. A value of "
"zero disables this feature. The altitude is calculated as being above ground"
" level. The height above ground is given from a Lidar used if available and "
":ref:`RNGFND_LANDING<RNGFND_LANDING>` bit 0 or 1 is set, or from terrain "
"data if :ref:`TERRAIN_FOLLOW<TERRAIN_FOLLOW>` =1, or comes from the height "
"above home otherwise."
msgstr ""
"第三种触发辅助的条件（当 :ref:`Q_ASSIST_SPEED<Q_ASSIST_SPEED>` 为正值时）是 "
":ref:`Q_ASSIST_ALT<Q_ASSIST_ALT>`。这是触发 QuadPlane 辅助的高度下限。其工作方式与 "
":ref:`Q_ASSIST_ANGLE <Q_ASSIST_ANGLE>` 和 "
":ref:`Q_ASSIST_SPEED<Q_ASSIST_SPEED>` 相同，但在 VTOL "
"电机未运行时飞行器低于该高度时触发。值为零则禁用此功能。高度以离地高度计算。离地高度由激光雷达（若可用且设置了 "
":ref:`RNGFND_LANDING<RNGFND_LANDING>` 第 0 或 1 位）提供，或由地形数据（若 "
":ref:`TERRAIN_FOLLOW<TERRAIN_FOLLOW>` =1）提供，否则来自 Home 以上高度。"

#: ../../source/docs/assisted_fixed_wing_flight.rst:32
#: 326bf1a214fe465d8c41fa99a90ada8a
msgid ""
"Assistance will be activated :ref:`Q_ASSIST_DELAY<Q_ASSIST_DELAY>` after any"
" of the above enabling thresholds are reached."
msgstr "达到上述任意启用阈值后，经过 :ref:`Q_ASSIST_DELAY<Q_ASSIST_DELAY>` 延迟后将激活辅助。"

#: ../../source/docs/assisted_fixed_wing_flight.rst:34
#: ea9eed2cce83499d8561cc0e514e72df
msgid ""
"Assistance can also be enabled, disabled, or forced by setting an RC switch "
"to ``RCx_OPTION`` = 82. If that channel is below  1200us (LOW), then "
"assistance is unconditionally disabled, if above 1800us, (HIGH) then "
"assistance is always enabled. For other RC values, assistance will be "
"enabled as explained above."
msgstr ""
"也可以通过将 RC 开关设为 ``RCx_OPTION`` = 82 来启用、禁用或强制开启辅助。若该通道低于 "
"1200us（低），则无条件禁用辅助；若高于 1800us（高），则始终启用辅助。其他 RC 值时，辅助将按上述说明启用。"

#: ../../source/docs/assisted_fixed_wing_flight.rst:36
#: 47aac78c23da4fb294cb8dbc9d4df7b4
msgid ""
"Assistance can also be forced active all the time by setting "
":ref:`Q_OPTIONS<Q_OPTIONS>` bit 7 to \"1\". For Tailsitters, assistance for "
"tailsitters can be limited only to VTOL motors by by setting "
":ref:`Q_OPTIONS<Q_OPTIONS>` bit 8 to \"1\". This can increase stability "
"during assistance by not using the copter style pid gains on the flying "
"surfaces as well as the VTOL motors, or for use with copter tailsitters "
"without servo-controlled flying surfaces."
msgstr ""
"也可以通过将 :ref:`Q_OPTIONS<Q_OPTIONS>` 的第 7 位设为「1」强制始终启用辅助。对于尾座式飞机，可通过将 "
":ref:`Q_OPTIONS<Q_OPTIONS>` 的第 8 位设为「1」将辅助限制为仅 VTOL 电机。这可以通过不在飞行舵面和 VTOL "
"电机上使用多旋翼式 PID 增益来提高辅助期间的稳定性，或用于没有舵机控制飞行舵面的多旋翼尾座式飞机。"

#: ../../source/docs/assisted_fixed_wing_flight.rst:38
#: 2aeeed69ad3d4faf94dbccb13c066524
msgid ""
"Assistance is available for all QuadPlane frame types except the single "
"motor and non-tilt dual motor tailsitter frames."
msgstr "辅助功能适用于除单电机和非倾转双电机尾座式机架以外的所有 QuadPlane 机架类型。"

#: ../../source/docs/assisted_fixed_wing_flight.rst:40
#: 7065800687a34943b6dd5d16ff1f4bc1
msgid ""
"What assistance the quad motors provides depends on the fixed wing flight "
"mode. If you are flying in an autonomous or semi-autonomous mode then the "
"quad motors will try to assist with whatever climb rate and turn rate the "
"autonomous flight mode wants when assistance is enabled (ie. airspeed is "
"below :ref:`Q_ASSIST_SPEED<Q_ASSIST_SPEED>` or attitude error is above "
":ref:`Q_ASSIST_ANGLE <Q_ASSIST_ANGLE>`, or altitude is below "
":ref:`Q_ASSIST_ALT<Q_ASSIST_ALT>` ). In a manually navigated mode the quad "
"will try to provide assistance that fits with the pilot inputs."
msgstr ""
"四轴电机提供何种辅助取决于固定翼飞行模式。若在自主或半自主模式下飞行，当辅助启用时（即空速低于 "
":ref:`Q_ASSIST_SPEED<Q_ASSIST_SPEED>` 或姿态误差高于 :ref:`Q_ASSIST_ANGLE "
"<Q_ASSIST_ANGLE>`，或高度低于 "
":ref:`Q_ASSIST_ALT<Q_ASSIST_ALT>`），四轴电机将尝试辅助自主飞行模式所需的爬升率和转弯率。在手动导航模式下，四轴将尝试提供与飞手输入相匹配的辅助。"

#: ../../source/docs/assisted_fixed_wing_flight.rst:48
#: a75f2163fc5b4a928fa8b154bedc44c9
msgid "The specific handling is:"
msgstr "具体处理方式如下："

#: ../../source/docs/assisted_fixed_wing_flight.rst:50
#: 0eddddd8510249849a9fbcfd57c8e525
msgid ""
"In :ref:`AUTO <auto-mode>` mode the quad will provide lift to get to the "
"altitude of the next waypoint, and will help turn the aircraft at the rate "
"the navigation controller is demanding."
msgstr "在 :ref:`AUTO <auto-mode>` 模式下，四轴将提供升力以到达下一航点的高度，并以导航控制器要求的速率帮助飞机转弯。"

#: ../../source/docs/assisted_fixed_wing_flight.rst:53
#: da98fb825ff5412d80b410e6060b28de
msgid ""
"In fixed wing :ref:`LOITER <loiter-mode>`, :ref:`RTL <rtl-mode>` or GUIDED "
"modes the quad motors will try to assist with whatever climb rate and turn "
"rate the navigation controller is asking for."
msgstr ""
"在固定翼 :ref:`LOITER <loiter-mode>`、:ref:`RTL <rtl-mode>` 或 GUIDED "
"模式下，四轴电机将尝试辅助导航控制器要求的爬升率和转弯率。"

#: ../../source/docs/assisted_fixed_wing_flight.rst:56
#: 5c9761bc4b0146acb562687bc674bfb1
msgid ""
"In :ref:`CRUISE <cruise-mode>` or :ref:`FBWB <fbwb-mode>` mode the quad will"
" provide lift according to the pilot's demanded climb rate (controlled with "
"pitch stick). The quad motors will try to turn at the pilot demanded turn "
"rate (combining aileron and rudder input)."
msgstr ""
"在 :ref:`CRUISE <cruise-mode>` 或 :ref:`FBWB <fbwb-mode>` "
"模式下，四轴将根据飞手要求的爬升率（由俯仰摇杆控制）提供升力。四轴电机将尝试按飞手要求的转弯率转弯（结合副翼和方向舵输入）。"

#: ../../source/docs/assisted_fixed_wing_flight.rst:60
#: 930b78f840514e198e59cb4547752665
msgid ""
"In :ref:`FBWA <fbwa-mode>` mode the quad will assume that pitch stick input "
"is proportional to the climb rate the user wants. So if the user pulls back "
"on the pitch stick the quad motors will try to climb, and if the user pushes"
" forward on the pitch stick the quad motors will try to provide a stable "
"descent."
msgstr ""
"在 :ref:`FBWA <fbwa-mode>` "
"模式下，四轴将假设俯仰摇杆输入与用户期望的爬升率成正比。因此，若用户向后拉俯仰摇杆，四轴电机将尝试爬升；若向前推，四轴电机将尝试提供稳定的下降。"

#: ../../source/docs/assisted_fixed_wing_flight.rst:65
#: e32d520ec13d4acc9e98aba00391a8ec
msgid ""
"In :ref:`AUTOTUNE <autotune-mode>` mode the quad will provide the same "
"assistance as in :ref:`FBWA <fbwa-mode>`, but it is not a good idea to use "
":ref:`AUTOTUNE <autotune-mode>` mode with a high value of "
":ref:`Q_ASSIST_SPEED <Q_ASSIST_SPEED>` as the quad assistance will interfere"
" with the learning of the fixed wing gains."
msgstr ""
"在 :ref:`AUTOTUNE <autotune-mode>` 模式下，四轴将提供与 :ref:`FBWA <fbwa-mode>` "
"相同的辅助，但不建议在 :ref:`Q_ASSIST_SPEED <Q_ASSIST_SPEED>` 值较高时使用 :ref:`AUTOTUNE "
"<autotune-mode>` 模式，因为四轴辅助将干扰固定翼增益的学习。"

#: ../../source/docs/assisted_fixed_wing_flight.rst:70
#: 7c88d96c6974432fb3c4dc9a532f2c5d
msgid ""
"In :ref:`MANUAL <manual-mode>`, :ref:`ACRO <acro-mode>` and :ref:`TRAINING "
"<training-mode>` modes the quad motors will completely turn off. In those "
"modes the aircraft will fly purely as a fixed wing."
msgstr ""
"在 :ref:`MANUAL <manual-mode>`、:ref:`ACRO <acro-mode>` 和 :ref:`TRAINING "
"<training-mode>` 模式下，四轴电机将完全关闭。在这些模式下，飞行器将纯粹以固定翼模式飞行。"

#: ../../source/docs/assisted_fixed_wing_flight.rst:74
#: 71ea1d25d5de4dfa857ccd406f1b98d0
msgid ""
"In :ref:`STABILIZE <stabilize-mode>` mode the quad motors will try to "
"provide lift if assistance is turned on."
msgstr "在 :ref:`STABILIZE <stabilize-mode>` 模式下，若辅助已开启，四轴电机将尝试提供升力。"
